      "text": "अरे, ये तो बड़ी परेशानी है। मुझे बताइए कि मैं इसे कैसे पे कर सकता हूँ और क्या यह डेट सीस नहीं हो सकता?"
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "The payment link has been sent to your registered mobile via SMS. You can use it to pay at your convenience. Regarding the due date, I cannot change or extend it, but if you need to discuss this further, I can arrange for a colleague to call you back. Would that help?",
      "verified": true,
